# Names of environment variables whose literal values must never reach the public
# event feed. `lab log` replaces any occurrence of these values with [REDACTED],
# on top of the built-in pattern matching (sk-…, AKIA…, hf_…, ghp_…, bearer …).
# One name per line. The names are public; the values are what gets stripped.
NULLSILVER_TOKEN
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
HF_TOKEN
OPENAI_API_KEY
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
GITHUB_TOKEN
